-- VORQON — إصلاح أسعار v2 وأسماء الكتالوج (يُطبَّق مرة واحدة من bootstrap-db.js، محروس بصف catalog_fixups 'prices-v2')
-- Re-pricing from generate_catalog.py (v2) per-(type, size) ranges extracted from the
-- corrected live store (incl. the +5% increase): every price is a deterministic
-- hash-of-SKU point inside its type/size range; compare-at keeps its old discount ratio;
-- names carrying an attribute that v2 does not allow for their type are cleaned in both
-- languages, their slugs regenerated, and their template descriptions rebuilt from the
-- cleaned names. UPDATEs are keyed by SKU and guarded by IS DISTINCT FROM (idempotent).
-- Generated catalog data — NOT real supplier data.
BEGIN;

CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS catalog_fixups (
  name       TEXT PRIMARY KEY,
  applied_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()
);

